  "id": "rice-stuffed-green-peppers",
  "name": "Rice-Stuffed Green Peppers",
  "subtitle": "Tender peppers filled with herbed tomato rice and feta",
  "description": "Roasted green peppers hold a savory filling of Arborio rice, tomato, herbs, green onions, and feta.",
